### Authorization Service API Tests
### Базовый URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Регистрация пользователя с ролью GUEST
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "guest_user",
  "email": "guest@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": ["guest"]
}

### 2. Регистрация пользователя с ролью PREMIUM_USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "premium_user",
  "email": "premium@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": ["premium_user"]
}

### 3. Регистрация пользователя с ролью ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin_user",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": ["admin"]
}